入先の医療保険部門へ長期介護保険を申請してください。これは高齢者だけに支給されるものではありません"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/17-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"家族内に長期臥床の人がいる場合、褥瘡（床ずれ）を最大の敵と見なしましょう：電動エアマットレスの使用、定期的な体位変換、毎日、骨の突出部をチェックする"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/ja/tip/17-09","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"高齢者の白内障が視界に影響しているなら、眼科で手術の検討を。両目に症状がある場合は、二枚目の手術をあまり遅らせないこと"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/17-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"高齢者の犬の散歩ではリードを手に巻かず手のひらで握り、短く保つ。引っ張って飛び出さないよう犬を訓練する"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"現在地"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/book"},"children":["本を読む"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/book/17"},"children":["第17章"," ·"," ","家族に高齢者がいる場合"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"17-09"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["09"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-b"},"children":["エビデンス"," ","B"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"ja"},"children":["高齢者の白内障が視界に影響しているなら、眼科で手術の検討を。両目に症状がある場合は、二枚目の手術をあまり遅らせないこと"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"ja","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["70 歳以上の女性が、できるだけ早く片目の白内障手術を受けると、一年間の転倒回数が約3割4減少し、骨折する人も減少します。ただし、転倒したことのある人の数自体は減っていません。もう片方の目の手術については、転倒に関して明らかな差は見られませんでした。手術を受けた高齢者は、一年以内の大腿骨（股関節）骨折の確率が約1割6低くなります。"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["費用・手間"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["まずは高齢者を眼科へ連れて行き、医師に手術の必要性を判断してもらってください。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["効果"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["あるランダム化比較試験では、白内内障のある70 歳以上の女性 306 名を対象としました。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"記録する：高齢者の白内障が視界に影響しているなら、眼科で手術の検討を。両目に症状がある場合は、二枚目の手術をあまり遅らせないこと"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"できている"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"やることに追加"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"お気に入り"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"このヒントを共有"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"詳細を閉じる"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["費用・手間"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["まずは高齢者を眼科へ連れて行き、医師に手術の必要性を判断してもらってください。片目の手術は一度行われますが、多くの病院では日帰り手術として扱われ、当日中に帰宅可能です。両目に白内障がある場合は、二回に分けて行います。自己負担額については、眼内に挿入する眼内レンズ（人工レンズ）の選択肢や、現地の医療保険の適用範囲によって異なるため、術前に詳しく確認してください。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["効果"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["あるランダム化比較試験では、白内内障のある70 歳以上の女性 306 名を対象としました。半数は約4 週以内に片目の手術を受け、もう半数は通常通り12 ヶ月間待機しました。一年間において、早期に手術を受けたグループは転倒回数が約34%減少しました。転倒率の比（リスク比）は 0.66、95% 信頼区間（CI）は 0.45 から 0.96 でした。少なくとも一度は転倒した人の割合は、手術群が 49%、待機群が 45% で、減少は見られませんでした。二回以上転倒した人の割合は、手術群が 18%、待機群が 25% でした。手術群では 4 人（3%）が骨折し、待機群では 12 人（8%）でした。Cochrane（コクラン）のレビューはこの試験を取り上げており、結論として、女性の片目の手術は転倒回数を減少させるが、二枚目の目の手術には効果がないとしています。もう片方の目のランダム化比較試験では、70 歳以上の女性 239 名を対象としました。手術群の転倒率は 32% 低かったものの、この差は偶然である可能性があります（転倒率の比 0.68、95% CI 0.39 から 1.19）。米国の医療保険の 5% サンプリング調査では、65 歳以上の白内障患者が 1113640 人いました（2002 年から 2009 年）。この研究は追跡調査のみであり、対照群との比較は行っていません。手術を受けた人は、一年以内の大腿骨骨折の確率が約 16% 低い結果となりました（オッズ比 0.84、95% CI 0.81 から 0.87）。絶対的な差は 0.20 パーセントポイントであり、約 1000 人あたり 2 例減少することに相当します。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["出典"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Harwood RH, Foss AJ, Osborn F, Gregson RM, Zaman A, Masud T (2005). Falls and health status in elderly women following first eye cataract surgery: a randomised controlled trial. British Journal of Ophthalmology, 89(1), 53-59. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1136/bjo.2004.049478","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1136/bjo.2004.049478"]}," ; Foss AJ, Harwood RH, Osborn F, Gregson RM, Zaman A, Masud T (2006). Falls and health status in elderly women following second eye cataract surgery: a randomised controlled trial. Age and Ageing, 35(1), 66-71. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1093/ageing/afj005","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1093/ageing/afj005"]}," ; Gillespie LD, Robertson MC, Gillespie WJ, et al. (2012). Interventions for preventing falls in older people living in the community. Cochrane Database of Systematic Reviews, 9, CD007146. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1002/14651858.CD007146.pub3","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1002/14651858.CD007146.pub3"]}," ; Tseng VL, Yu F, Lum F, Coleman AL (2012). Risk of fractures following cataract surgery in Medicare beneficiaries. JAMA, 308(5), 493-501. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1001/jama.2012.9014","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1001/jama.2012.9014"]}," ; Desapriya E, Subzwari S, Scime-Beltrano G, et al. (2010). Vision improvement and reduction in falls after expedited cataract surgery: systematic review and metaanalysis. Journal of Cataract and Refractive Surgery, 36(1), 13-19. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcrs.2009.07.032","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcrs.2009.07.032"]}," ; Meuleners LB, Lee AH, Ng JQ, Morlet N, Fraser ML (2012). First eye cataract surgery and hospitalization from injuries due to a fall: a population-based study. Journal of the American Geriatrics Society, 60(9), 1730-1733. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1532-5415.2012.04098.x","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1532-5415.2012.04098.x"]}," ; Meuleners LB, Fraser ML, Ng J, Morlet N (2014). The impact of first- and second-eye cataract surgery on injurious falls that require hospitalisation: a whole-population study. Age and Ageing, 43(3), 341-346. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1093/ageing/aft177","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1093/ageing/aft177"]}," ; Keay L, Ho KC, Rogers K, et al. (2022). The incidence of falls after first and second eye cataract surgery: a longitudinal cohort study. Medical Journal of Australia, 217(2), 94-99. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.5694/mja2.51611","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.5694/mja2.51611"]}," ; 国家卫生健康委 (2022). 「十四五」全国眼健康规划（2021-2025年）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2022-01/17/content_5668951.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2022-01/17/content_5668951.htm"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1136/bjo.2004.049478","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["出典を開く"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["著者の注記"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["論争点：2 つのランダム化比較試験を合わせて計算すると、転倒したことのある人の数に明らかな減少は見られませんでした（オッズ比 0.81、95% CI 0.55 から 1.17）。オーストラリア西部の全人口の入院記録では、片目の手術後の一年間において、転倒による負傷での入院が逆に 27% 増えました。二度の手術の間、この種の入院は術前の 2.14 倍に達しています。この前後比較では、手術の影響と加齢による影響を切り分けることはできません。もう一つのオーストラリアの追跡研究では、二枚目の目の手術後、転倒回数が最も減少しました。したがって、両目に白内障がある場合は、二枚目の手術をあまり遅らせないでください。二度の手術の間は、歩行や階段の昇降には格別の注意が必要です。また、Cochrane は高齢者の視力問題に対処する別の試験も取り上げていますが、そこでは転倒回数が約5割7も増加しました。手術が対処するのは「見え方」であり、転倒を減らすには第 1 節 第 13 条（バランスと脚力）に頼る必要があります。骨が転倒に耐えられるかどうかについては、第 1 節 第 39 条（骨密度検査）および第 1 節 第 40 条（骨粗鬆症と判明した場合は投薬）を参照してください。国家眼健康計画には、白内障の視力回復手術はすでに郡レベルで広く実施されており、必ずしも大都市の病院へ行く必要はないと明記されています。この恩恵を受ける主な対象は、あなたの両親や祖父母です。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["自分のメモ"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["自分へのメモを書く…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/ja/tip/17-08"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["前へ"]},"家族内に長期臥床の人がいる場合、褥瘡（床ずれ）を最大の敵と見なしましょう：電動エアマットレスの使用、定期的な体位変換、毎日、骨の突出部をチェックする"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/ja/tip/17-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["次へ"]},"高齢者の犬の散歩ではリードを手に巻かず手のひらで握り、短く保つ。引っ張って飛び出さないよう犬を訓練する"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["このテーマの他の提案"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/17-02"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["遺言を作成しましょう。後から作成したものが前のものを覆すため、公証遺言が優先されるとは限りません"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["法律は6種類の遺言を認めていますが、形式を間違えると書面全体が無効になります。これが最もよくある失敗です。自筆によるものは、本人が最初から…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/17-03"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["高齢者の資金は別口座で管理し、高額支出には二人確認のルールを設ける"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["高齢者を狙う詐欺では、贈り物や親身な言葉で信頼を積み上げてから大金を奪います。「誰にも言わないで」と口止めするのも典型です。一定額以上の支…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/17-04"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["高齢者がいつでも使える、断るためのフレーズ：「家族と相談させてください」"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["勧誘や詐欺は、その場の圧力で考える前に払わせようとします。感情が高ぶると誇張広告を信じやすく、高齢者は若い人より説得されやすい傾向がありま…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/17-05"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["高齢者に先払いを求める「投資型老後プラン」には一切手を出さないこと：カード作成、ベッド確保、介護マンション、移住型老後生活、高齢者向け製品の購入は、すべて同一の違法集金の手口です"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["高齢者に先払いを求め、かつリターンを約束する老後プランは、すべて同じ詐欺の手口です。カード作成、ベッド確保、介護マンション、移住型老後生活…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/17-06"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["保険会社による住宅リバースモーゲージ型年金保険を除き、他の「自宅を活用した老後プラン」には一切手を出さないこと。絶対に住宅を担保に理財商品を買ってはいけない"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["正規の住宅を活用した老後プランは、保険会社による住宅リバースモーゲージ型年金保険（現在、試験運用中）のただ一種のみです。訪問販売されるもの…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/17-07"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["家族内に長期臥床または重度の障害がある人がいる場合、加入先の医療保険部門へ長期介護保険を申請してください。これは高齢者だけに支給されるものではありません"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["長期介護保険は、介護を依頼するための費用を補助してくれます。家族に重度の障害があり、半年以上継続している場合は、加入先の医療保険部門へ申請…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/ja/book/17"},"children":["テーマ全体を読む：家族に高齢者がいる場合"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-